Package: softglowos-drivers
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Kevin Schmidt <https://github.com/kevinschmidt777/softglowos>
Homepage: https://softglowos.com
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: linux-firmware, libgl1-mesa-dri, mesa-libgallium, mesa-vulkan-drivers,
 intel-media-va-driver-non-free, libvpl2, libmfx-gen1.2, ubuntu-drivers-common,
 switcheroo-control
Recommends: vainfo, vulkan-tools
Description: Graphics drivers and settings for SoftglowOS
 AMD, Intel and NVIDIA on one system: Mesa for AMD and Intel (Vulkan, OpenGL,
 video encoding through VA-API), Intel Quick Sync for OBS, switcheroo-control
 for PCs with two graphics cards, and ubuntu-drivers, which installs the
 signed NVIDIA driver that fits the card. For NVIDIA it adds the settings of
 the Bazzite image: power saving, NVIDIA's USB controllers on the card
 switched off, nvidia-persistenced off, and the older GL renderer for GTK 4
 apps while the free nouveau driver runs.
